[00:19.88]When a man becomes a father
[00:23.88]And a woman has a child of her own,
[00:29.40]They share a trust, they must remember,
[00:34.38]That is not theirs, not theirs alone.
[00:39.34]The gift they share is from Jehovah;
[00:44.28]Of life and love he is the one true Source.
[00:49.10]To parents he gives sure direction
[00:53.34]That they may follow the wisest course.
[00:58.95](Chorus)
[00:59.10]A sacred trust you have been given;
[01:03.85]A precious life is in your hands.
[01:08.98]You can bestow the greatest favor;
[01:13.97]Instruct your child in God’s commands.
[01:26.78]All the words God has commanded—
[01:31.60]They must always prove to be on your heart.
[01:36.22]These words you’ll speak to sons and daughters;
[01:41.18]This is your trust, this is your part.
[01:46.16]To them you’ll speak along your roadway,
[01:51.12]When you rise up and when you are at rest.
[01:56.06]In years to come, may they remember,
[02:00.96]May they be faithful, may they be blessed.
[02:05.75](Chorus)
[02:05.90]A sacred trust you have been given;
[02:10.66]A precious life is in your hands.
[02:15.82]You can bestow the greatest favor;
[02:20.92]Instruct your child in God’s commands.
